# Periscope — Cursor agent rules (OpenClaw fork)

Canonical design: `orama-system` repo → `docs/v2/21-periscope-l4-glass.md` and
`docs/plans/2026-05-24-periscope-l4-integration-plan.md` (read when changing integration
or parsers).

## Branch model (non-negotiable)

| Branch | Role |
|--------|------|
| **`agentsview`** | **Grandmother** — latest upstream agentsview lineage; refresh feature work from here |
| **`main`** | **Upstream mirror only** — tracks `latentsignal-org/periscope`; **not** the build target |
| **`merged`** | **Build branch** — combines `agentsview` + `main` + fork-specific work |

**Rules:**

1. **All fork PRs** (deps, OpenClaw integration, docs, renames) use **`base = merged`**.
2. **Never** merge build/integration work into **`main`**.
3. **Never** use restored **`main`** as a salvage source — wrong-target merges were reset; only
   cherry-pick **patch content** onto **`merged`**.
4. **`agentsview` is fully absorbed into `merged`** when `git log merged..agentsview` is empty;
   do not re-merge `agentsview` wholesale without operator approval.

## Salvage (right commit, wrong target)

When dependabot or agents merged to old **`main`**:

| Change | Action on `merged` |
|--------|-------------------|
| Go `pgx` bump | Usually **already present** — verify `go.mod` before opening a PR |
| npm (`svelte`, `postcss`, …) | Prefer **targeted** bumps on `merged`; do not downgrade `marked` |
| cargo / `tauri` lock | **Cherry-pick or merge** cargo lock bump onto `merged` |
| Stale doc branches (e.g. old `AGENTS.md` only) | **Cherry-pick the file hunk** onto `merged` — **never** merge a branch based on pre-`merged` history |

Close PRs that target **`main`** (#5, #6, superseded #1–#3).

## Stack position (L4)

Periscope is **observation-only** (L4). **Never** write to AlphaClaw, Perpetua-Tools, or
orama-system. Parsers and routes **read** their logs; OpenClaw-specific server routes stay in
this fork unless explicitly upstreamed.

## Git identity (Cursor / cloud)

1. Author: **`cyre <diazMelgarejo@gmail.com>`** or **`cyre <Lawrence@cyre.me>`** only.
2. **Do not** add `Co-authored-by:`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or trailers with **forbidden**
